摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"AnySearch web search provider and advanced search tools for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)","id":"gh:1333247282","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"anysearch-dsh","slug":"anysearch-team/anysearch-dsh","topics":["agent-tools","anysearch","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","typescript","web-search"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"AnySearch web search provider and advanced search tools for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"@anysearch/anysearch-dsh\nAnySearch-powered real-time web and vertical search for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`@anysearch/anysearch-dsh` connects AnySearch to DeepSeek Harness as a plugin. Keep using Harness's "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"native `web_search` and `web_fetch` while gaining real-time web search, cleaned URL content, vertica"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"l search, and concurrent batch search."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"AnySearch is search infrastructure for AI agents, covering the public web and specialized data sourc"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"es across code, finance, academia, law, security, and more."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### For AI Agents"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### For Humans"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Install the plugin into the `web` profile:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Start DeepSeek Harness:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"No API key is required for a quick start. Requests use AnySearch's anonymous quota until you configu"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"key is required for a quick start. Requests use AnySearch's anonymous quota until you configure one."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- Through Harness's built-in `web_search`, AnySearch returns results with titles, snippets, and URLs"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" for easy citation.\n- Through Harness's built-in `web_fetch`, AnySearch Extract retrieves and cleans"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" the content of a specific public HTTP(S) URL.\n- Discover searchable domains, vertical categories, a"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"nd supported parameters in real time, then run advanced searches using tags, regions, languages, and"},{"id":"p16s5","text":" structured parameters.\n- Run one to five searches concurrently; an individual failure does not affe"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ct the other results.\n- Advanced search preserves useful structured results without source URLs, whi"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"le page-backed results can return cleaned content on demand."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Optional API key"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Try it without an API key."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Sign up for an AnySearch account and configure an API key to get 1,000 free search calls per day."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Sign up or sign in at anysearch.com, then visit API Keys to get one. Store the key in `$DSH_HOME/.cr"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"edentials.yaml` (`~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml` by default):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The plugin resolves the managed credential for every operation, so credential rotation reaches the n"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ext request without restarting DSH. A launching `ANYSEARCH_API_KEY` environment variable has higher "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"st without restarting DSH. A launching `ANYSEARCH_API_KEY` environment variable has higher priority."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Inspect the composed profile without exposing the credential value:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Use case | Harness tool |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Ordinary web search | `web_search` |\n| Fetch and clean a specific URL | `web_fetch` |\n| Discover a"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"vailable domains and tags | `anysearch_capabilities` |\n| Vertical or parameterized search | `anysear"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ch_search` |\n| Run one to five searches together | `anysearch_batch_search` |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For ordinary prompts, let Harness select the tool. Models can discover live domain and parameter def"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"initions before making a specialized search."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Environment requirements"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Requires Node.js 22.19 or Node.js 24+, pnpm 11.7, and DeepSeek Harness. The DSH plugin command uses "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"pnpm to manage profile dependencies, so `pnpm` must be available on `PATH`."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Windows, Linux, and macOS use the same installation command. Before installing, ensure that Node.js,"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" `npx`, and `pnpm` can all be run directly from `PATH`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"The bundled profile layer automatically selects AnySearch as the existing `ctx.web` search and fetch"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" provider, enables `web_fetch`, and mounts the advanced tools, so no changes are required by default"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"provider, enables `web_fetch`, and mounts the advanced tools, so no changes are required by default."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"To customize it, ask an AI assistant—or edit it manually—to add the complete block below to the targ"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"et DSH profile's user configuration layer, overriding the bundled `id: web-search-anysearch` entry. "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"Keep the `id` unchanged, replace the complete `config`, and do not add a second AnySearch provider u"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"nder a different ID:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Field | Default | Purpose |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| `apiKeyEnv` | `ANYSEARCH_API_KEY` | DSH credential reference; missing uses anonymous access |\n| `b"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"aseURL` | `https://api.anysearch.com` | AnySearch API base URL |\n| `maxRenderedContentChars` | `1200"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"0` | Maximum result-content characters rendered to the model per advanced tool call |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Manage the plugin"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Update:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Remove:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Compatibility and limitations"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness is in developer preview and may make compatibility-breaking changes.\n- This sourc"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"e tree covers 28 published DSH releases, from `0.0.1-rc.5` through `0.2.1-alpha.1`, including `0.1.5"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"-rc.2`. See the version matrix, validation scope, and publication status.\n- New DSH versions are all"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"owed by default, including alpha and rc releases; the tested matrix is not an installation allowlist"},{"id":"p44s5","text":". Report actual compatibility problems in issues.\n- URL extraction is exposed through Harness's prov"},{"id":"p44s6","text":"ider-neutral `web_fetch`; the plugin does not add a duplicate `anysearch_extract` tool.\n- Configure "},{"id":"p44s7","text":"the API key through DSH-managed credentials or an environment variable; the DSH settings page does n"},{"id":"p44s8","text":"ot currently provide a third-party Provider credential field."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"- Chinese user guide\n- DSH plugin, Skill, MCP, and HTTP integration comparison"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Community & Support"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Join the AnySearch community to share your experience, report issues, and get technical support."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"- GitHub Issues: submit bug reports and usage feedback.\n- WeChat Group: scan the QR code below and c"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"omplete the group survey; staff will invite you after review.\n- Discord Community: scan the QR code "},{"id":"p49s3","text":"or follow the link to join directly."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"WeChat group survey"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Discord invite"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"The live AnySearch E2E suite is opt-in. Run it without ambient credentials in anonymous mode:"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
